{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8bf6768d-db0e-11ef-83b3-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8bf67679-db0e-11ef-b621-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"高陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f443-db0e-11ef-8991-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：戎事則稱車右，其餘則曰參乘。參者，三也，蓋取三人爲義。乘，繩證翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：戎事则称车右，其余则曰参乘。参者，三也，盖取三人为义。乘，绳证翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f442-db0e-11ef-92d3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"班","people_name_jianti_auto":"班","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f445-db0e-11ef-9d3a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵县","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f446-db0e-11ef-82e6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"左馮翊","place_name_jianti_auto":"左冯翊","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f447-db0e-11ef-b8ef-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","place_note":"陝西高陵","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f448-db0e-11ef-8d71-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雍州","place_name_jianti_auto":"雍州","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f449-db0e-11ef-9cef-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵县","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f44a-db0e-11ef-9c02-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"傳，株戀翻。班志，高陵縣屬左馮翊。括地志：高陵故城在雍州高陵縣西一里。從，才用翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"传，株恋翻。班志，高陵县属左冯翊。括地志：高陵故城在雍州高陵县西一里。从，才用翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f444-db0e-11ef-9e64-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"蘇林","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏林","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f44e-db0e-11ef-88bb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"秦昭王","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦昭王","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f44f-db0e-11ef-a802-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭橋","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭桥","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f450-db0e-11ef-8adb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長安","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f451-db0e-11ef-a51d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"咸陽宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"咸阳宫","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f452-db0e-11ef-bb1a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"渭","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f453-db0e-11ef-89c0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"興樂宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"兴乐宫","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f454-db0e-11ef-93a8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"渭","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f455-db0e-11ef-95f4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"渭橋","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭桥","start_index":41,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f456-db0e-11ef-afc8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f457-db0e-11ef-93b2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京兆","place_name_jianti_auto":"京兆","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f458-db0e-11ef-ae18-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"蘇林曰：渭橋，在長安北三里。索隱曰：咸陽宮在渭北，興樂宮在渭南，秦昭王通兩宮之間作渭橋，長三百八十步。關中記云：石柱以北屬扶風，石柱以南屬京兆。","note_content_jianti_auto":"苏林曰：渭桥，在长安北三里。索隐曰：咸阳宫在渭北，兴乐宫在渭南，秦昭王通两宫之间作渭桥，长三百八十步。关中记云：石柱以北属扶风，石柱以南属京兆。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f44d-db0e-11ef-b06b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"包愷","people_name_jianti_auto":"包恺","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f45c-db0e-11ef-adca-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f45d-db0e-11ef-9737-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"包愷曰：閒，音閑；言欲向空閑處。師古曰：閒，容也，猶今言中閒也；請容暇之頃，當有所陳，不欲於衆中顯論也。他皆類此。","note_content_jianti_auto":"包恺曰：闲，音闲；言欲向空闲处。师古曰：闲，容也，犹今言中闲也；请容暇之顷，当有所陈，不欲于众中显论也。他皆类此。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":88,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f45b-db0e-11ef-b880-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","place_note":"陝西高陵","resolved_place_entity_id":1674,"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f462-db0e-11ef-965d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"始元初，大雨，渭桥绝。甘露二年，呼韩邪单于来朝甘泉，就邸...","context_before":"...属扶风，以南属京兆。其北首垒石水中，故曰石柱，亦曰渭桥。","source_end_index":232,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6f030669-8df2-536a-99a4-5b3dc3ca1090","source_start_index":181,"source_text":"汉吕后之乱，大臣迎立代王。王至高陵，使宋昌驰之长安观变。昌至渭桥，丞相以下皆迎。昌还报，王乃驰至渭桥。"},{"context_after":"更始末，赤眉至高陵，王匡等迎降。潘岳《关中记》：三辅旧治...","context_before":"...里。《括地志》：即高陵故城也。秦昭王封同母弟显为高陵君。","source_end_index":58,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ae262f21-25bf-5d68-95a2-0bbecc15ba3d","source_start_index":38,"source_text":"又吕氏之变，代王乘传诣长安，至高陵休止。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"乃命宋昌參乘，張武等六人乘傳，從詣長安。至高陵，休止，而使宋昌先馳之長安觀變。昌至渭橋，丞相以下皆迎。昌還報。代王馳至渭橋，羣臣拜謁稱臣，代王下車答拜。太尉勃進曰：「願請閒。」宋昌曰：「所言公，公言之；所言私，王者無私。」太尉乃跪上天子璽、符。代王謝曰：「至代邸而議之。」","content_fanyi":"于是命令宋昌作为陪乘，张武等六人乘坐官府驿车，跟随代王前往长安。行至高陵县，暂停休整，代王命宋昌先驰入长安观察动静。宋昌到达渭桥，丞相及以下百官都来迎接。宋昌回来报告。代王驱车赶到渭桥，群臣跪拜进见，俯首称臣，代王下车答拜。太尉周勃上前说：“希望与您单独交谈。”宋昌说：“您要说的如果是公事，就公开说；如果是私事，做王的人没有私情。”太尉这才跪下，呈上天子专用的印玺和符节。代王辞谢说：“到代国官邸再商议此事。”","content_jianti_auto":"乃命宋昌参乘，张武等六人乘传，从诣长安。至高陵，休止，而使宋昌先驰之长安观变。昌至渭桥，丞相以下皆迎。昌还报。代王驰至渭桥，群臣拜谒称臣，代王下车答拜。太尉勃进曰：「愿请闲。」宋昌曰：「所言公，公言之；所言私，王者无私。」太尉乃跪上天子玺、符。代王谢曰：「至代邸而议之。」","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，世庙罢新都之政柄，不得谓之刻核而寡恩。成帝之碌碌，何足...","context_before":"...；丙吉护宣帝于狱而终不自白，故能相天子以成中兴之业。然则","source_end_index":211,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"9a09d43f-4292-4b10-a4ed-96fd7c9ec34f","source_start_index":203,"source_text":"汉文却周勃之私言"}],"title":"七 汉亡非元帝之过"},{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，斯则善于用密者与！","context_before":"...纤曲，以茅缚虎、以油试火之术耳，而后从珂之死亡终不可救。","source_end_index":130,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"385e99e5-e6db-470e-90b6-06c72efbcd55","source_start_index":116,"source_text":"宋昌拒周勃之请间，而中外帖然"}],"title":"一四 机密乃成败之源"}],"id":1057,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第十三 (漢紀五) / 高皇后 / 八年 / 第 20 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"8eb7f441-db0e-11ef-a268-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-180},"tongjian_id":"8eb7f441-db0e-11ef-a268-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"高陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"911d1410-db0e-11ef-b993-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"左馮翊","place_name_jianti_auto":"左冯翊","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"911d1411-db0e-11ef-9b21-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"高陵縣屬左馮翊。行，下孟翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"高陵县属左冯翊。行，下孟翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"911d140f-db0e-11ef-887d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"賢","people_name_jianti_auto":"贤","start_index":99,"tongjian_id":"911d1413-db0e-11ef-bcf0-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"高帝","start_index":122,"tongjian_id":"911d1414-db0e-11ef-ac5d-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"高后","people_name_jianti_auto":"高后","start_index":132,"tongjian_id":"911d1415-db0e-11ef-b979-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"重，直用翻。賢長吏，謂縣令、丞也。續漢志：縣有嗇夫，皆主知民善惡、爲役先後，知民貧富、爲賦多少，平其差品。三老，掌敎化，凡有孝子、順孫、貞女、義婦、讓財、救患及學士爲民法式者，皆扁表其門，以興善行。賢曰：三老、孝弟、力田，三者皆鄕官之名。三老，高帝置，孝弟、力田，高后置，所以勸導鄕里，助成風化也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"重，直用翻。贤长吏，谓县令、丞也。续汉志：县有啬夫，皆主知民善恶、为役先后，知民贫富、为赋多少，平其差品。三老，掌教化，凡有孝子、顺孙、贞女、义妇、让财、救患及学士为民法式者，皆扁表其门，以兴善行。贤曰：三老、孝弟、力田，三者皆鄕官之名。三老，高帝置，孝弟、力田，高后置，所以劝导鄕里，助成风化也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"911d1412-db0e-11ef-9c99-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"傳，知戀翻；下傳相同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"传，知恋翻；下传相同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":109,"tongjian_id":"911d1417-db0e-11ef-9271-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"911d1419-db0e-11ef-958c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：移，猶傳也。一說：兄以讓弟，弟又讓兄，故云相移。復，扶又翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：移，犹传也。一说：兄以让弟，弟又让兄，故云相移。复，扶又翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":172,"tongjian_id":"911d1418-db0e-11ef-baab-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"馮翊","place_name_jianti_auto":"冯翊","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"911d141c-db0e-11ef-b66a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"911d141d-db0e-11ef-bd9f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"櫟陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"栎阳","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"911d141e-db0e-11ef-91f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"翟道","place_name_jianti_auto":"翟道","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"911d141f-db0e-11ef-a002-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"池陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"池阳","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"911d1420-db0e-11ef-9470-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"夏陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"夏阳","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"911d1421-db0e-11ef-99d7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"衙","place_name_jianti_auto":"衙","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"911d1422-db0e-11ef-8bba-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"粟邑","place_name_jianti_auto":"粟邑","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"911d1423-db0e-11ef-bd09-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"谷口","place_name_jianti_auto":"谷口","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"911d1424-db0e-11ef-901d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"蓮勺","place_name_jianti_auto":"莲勺","start_index":26,"tongjian_id":"911d1425-db0e-11ef-aeb2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄜","place_name_jianti_auto":"鄜","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"911d1426-db0e-11ef-a63b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"頻陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"频阳","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"911d1427-db0e-11ef-bb3e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"臨晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"临晋","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"911d1428-db0e-11ef-a153-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"重泉","place_name_jianti_auto":"重泉","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"911d1429-db0e-11ef-814e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"郃陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"郃阳","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"911d142a-db0e-11ef-be5b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"祋祤","place_name_jianti_auto":"祋祤","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"911d142b-db0e-11ef-bc73-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"武城","place_name_jianti_auto":"武城","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"911d142c-db0e-11ef-9b34-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"沈陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"沈阳","start_index":49,"tongjian_id":"911d142d-db0e-11ef-90a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"褱德","place_name_jianti_auto":"褱德","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"911d142e-db0e-11ef-b8a7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"徵","place_name_jianti_auto":"征","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"911d142f-db0e-11ef-806d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雲陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"云陵","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"911d1430-db0e-11ef-a522-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"萬年","place_name_jianti_auto":"万年","start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"911d1431-db0e-11ef-afdc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"长陵","start_index":63,"tongjian_id":"911d1432-db0e-11ef-bcba-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"陽陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"阳陵","start_index":66,"tongjian_id":"911d1433-db0e-11ef-89ec-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雲陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"云阳","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"911d1434-db0e-11ef-a575-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"馮翊統高陵、櫟陽、翟道、池陽、夏陽、衙、粟邑、谷口、蓮勺、鄜、頻陽、臨晉、重泉、郃陽、祋祤、武城、沈陽、褱德、徵、雲陵、萬年、長陵、陽陵、雲陽二十四縣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"冯翊统高陵、栎阳、翟道、池阳、夏阳、衙、粟邑、谷口、莲勺、鄜、频阳、临晋、重泉、郃阳、祋祤、武城、沈阳、褱德、征、云陵、万年、长陵、阳陵、云阳二十四县。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":199,"tongjian_id":"911d141b-db0e-11ef-959a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"911d1436-db0e-11ef-81d9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：紿，誑也，音蕩亥翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：绐，诳也，音荡亥翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":220,"tongjian_id":"911d1435-db0e-11ef-b83f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"911d140e-db0e-11ef-add1-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"kūn","source_anchor_text":"自悔皆自髡肉袒謝願","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":153,"text":"髡","tongjian_id":"3c21252e-d557-5e51-be9c-b581144c2200"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"911d140e-db0e-11ef-add1-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"biàn","source_anchor_text":"壽恩信周徧二十四縣","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":193,"text":"徧","tongjian_id":"da05704b-d113-5a62-addc-851465b8f5f6"},{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"911d140e-db0e-11ef-add1-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"dài","source_anchor_text":"民不忍欺紿匈奴單于","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":218,"text":"紿","tongjian_id":"a33c458b-9d3d-5a7a-87df-8aa8e63182d8"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","place_note":"陝西高陵","resolved_place_entity_id":1674,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"911d1438-db0e-11ef-80fb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"延壽出行縣至高陵，民有昆弟相與訟田，自言。延壽大傷之，曰：「幸得備位，爲郡表率，不能宣明敎化，至令民有骨肉爭訟，旣傷風化，重使賢長吏、嗇夫、三老、孝弟受其恥，咎在馮翊，當先退！」是日，移病不聽事，因入臥傳舍，閉閤思過。一縣莫知所爲，令、丞、嗇夫、三老亦皆自繫待罪。於是訟者宗族傳相責讓；此兩昆弟深自悔，皆自髡，肉袒謝，願以田相移，終死不敢復爭。郡中歙然，莫不傳相敕厲，不敢犯。延壽恩信周徧二十四縣，莫敢以辭訟自言者。推其至誠，吏民不忍欺紿。","content_fanyi":"韩延寿巡行属县，来到高陵，百姓中有兄弟因田产互相争讼，主动前来向他申诉。韩延寿深感悲伤，说：“我有幸居左冯翊之位，作为全郡表率，不能宣明教化，致使百姓中出现骨肉争讼，既有伤风化，又让贤明的长吏以及啬夫、三老、孝弟等乡官蒙受耻辱，过错在我这个左冯翊，应当先行退下！”当天，他声称有病，不再处理政事，随后住进传舍，闭门思过。全县之人不知该怎么办，县令、县丞、啬夫、三老也都自缚等候治罪。于是争讼者的宗族互相传告责备；兄弟二人深深悔恨，都剃去头发，袒露上身前来谢罪，愿意把田地让给对方，至死不敢再争。郡中风气和洽，人们无不互相告诫勉励，不敢再犯。韩延寿的恩德信义遍及二十四县，没有人敢以诉讼之事主动向他陈说。推究他的至诚之心，官吏百姓不忍心欺骗他。","content_jianti_auto":"延寿出行县至高陵，民有昆弟相与讼田，自言。延寿大伤之，曰：「幸得备位，为郡表率，不能宣明教化，至令民有骨肉争讼，既伤风化，重使贤长吏、啬夫、三老、孝弟受其耻，咎在冯翊，当先退！」是日，移病不听事，因入卧传舍，闭合思过。一县莫知所为，令、丞、啬夫、三老亦皆自系待罪。于是讼者宗族传相责让；此两昆弟深自悔，皆自髡，肉袒谢，愿以田相移，终死不敢复争。郡中歙然，莫不传相敕厉，不敢犯。延寿恩信周徧二十四县，莫敢以辞讼自言者。推其至诚，吏民不忍欺绐。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2112,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第二十六 (漢紀十八) / 中宗孝宣皇帝中 / 三年 / 第 5 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"911d140e-db0e-11ef-add1-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-59},"tongjian_id":"911d140e-db0e-11ef-add1-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":2},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"高陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"去年七月大赦。","note_content_jianti_auto":"去年七月大赦。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":82,"tongjian_id":"91b9aa9a-db0e-11ef-a2a3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"樂安侯","people_name_jianti_auto":"乐安侯","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"91b9aa9c-db0e-11ef-a4d6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"衡封樂安侯。","note_content_jianti_auto":"衡封乐安侯。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":162,"tongjian_id":"91b9aa9b-db0e-11ef-a7a1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","resolved_place_entity_id":1674,"start_index":179,"tongjian_id":"91b9aaa9-db0e-11ef-ab5f-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"司隸校尉涿郡王尊劾奏：「丞相衡、御史大夫譚，知顯等顓權擅勢，大作威福，爲海內患害，不以時白奏行罰；而阿諛曲從，附下罔上，懷邪迷國，無大臣輔政之義，皆不道！在赦令前。赦後，衡、譚舉奏顯，不自陳不忠之罪，而反揚著先帝任用傾覆之徒，妄言『百官畏之，甚於主上』；卑君尊臣，非所宜稱，失大臣體！」於是衡慙懼，免冠謝罪，上丞相、侯印綬。天子以新卽位，重傷大臣，乃左遷尊爲高陵令。然羣下多是尊者。衡嘿嘿不自安，每有水旱，連乞骸骨讓位；上輒以詔書慰撫，不許。","content_fanyi":"司隶校尉涿郡人王尊上奏弹劾说：“丞相匡衡、御史大夫张谭，明知石显等人专权擅势，大作威福，成为海内祸害，却不及时奏报皇上、对他们加以惩罚；反而阿谀曲从，依附臣下、欺骗君上，心怀奸邪、迷乱国政，没有大臣辅政应尽的节义，都是大逆不道！这些罪行都在大赦以前，可以不追究。大赦以后，匡衡、张谭举奏石显，却不陈述自己不忠的罪过，反而宣扬先帝任用了倾覆国家的奸邪小人，妄称‘百官畏惧石显，超过畏惧主上’；贬低君主、抬高臣下，不是臣子应当说的话，有失大臣体统！”于是匡衡又惭愧又恐惧，脱下帽子谢罪，交上丞相、侯的印绶。天子因为刚刚即位，不忍深责大臣，便把王尊降职为高陵令。然而群下大多认为王尊说得对。匡衡默默自感不安，每逢有水旱灾害，就接连乞骸骨让位；皇上总是下诏慰抚，不予准许。","content_jianti_auto":"司隶校尉涿郡王尊劾奏：「丞相衡、御史大夫谭，知显等颛权擅势，大作威福，为海内患害，不以时白奏行罚；而阿谀曲从，附下罔上，怀邪迷国，无大臣辅政之义，皆不道！在赦令前。赦后，衡、谭举奏显，不自陈不忠之罪，而反扬著先帝任用倾覆之徒，妄言『百官畏之，甚于主上』；卑君尊臣，非所宜称，失大臣体！」于是衡慙惧，免冠谢罪，上丞相、侯印绶。天子以新即位，重伤大臣，乃左迁尊为高陵令。然群下多是尊者。衡嘿嘿不自安，每有水旱，连乞骸骨让位；上辄以诏书慰抚，不许。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2334,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三十 (漢紀二十二) / 孝成皇帝上之上 / 建始元年 / 第 3 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"91b9aa98-db0e-11ef-8e94-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-32},"tongjian_id":"91b9aa98-db0e-11ef-8e94-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":3},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"高陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"蘇林","people_name_jianti_auto":"苏林","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"91c52e60-db0e-11ef-9eac-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉灼","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋灼","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"91c52e61-db0e-11ef-9307-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"91c52e62-db0e-11ef-b8c1-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"91c52e63-db0e-11ef-9111-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"蘇林曰：傰，音朋；晉灼曰：音倍。師古曰：晉音是也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"苏林曰：傰，音朋；晋灼曰：音倍。师古曰：晋音是也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"91c52e5f-db0e-11ef-bb05-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"91c52e66-db0e-11ef-80af-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"師古曰：在天子輦轂之下，明其逼近也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"师古曰：在天子辇毂之下，明其逼近也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"91c52e65-db0e-11ef-86b5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"武帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"武帝","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"91c52e68-db0e-11ef-8470-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"三輔","place_name_jianti_auto":"三辅","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"91c52e69-db0e-11ef-b8d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京兆","place_name_jianti_auto":"京兆","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"91c52e6a-db0e-11ef-b953-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京輔","place_name_jianti_auto":"京辅","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"91c52e6b-db0e-11ef-a33c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"馮翊","place_name_jianti_auto":"冯翊","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"91c52e6c-db0e-11ef-ae45-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"左輔","place_name_jianti_auto":"左辅","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"91c52e6d-db0e-11ef-83d0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"91c52e6e-db0e-11ef-8d97-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"右輔","place_name_jianti_auto":"右辅","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"91c52e6f-db0e-11ef-a2ff-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"武帝元鼎四年，更置三輔都尉：京兆曰京輔都尉，馮翊曰左輔都尉，扶風曰右輔都尉。","note_content_jianti_auto":"武帝元鼎四年，更置三辅都尉：京兆曰京辅都尉，冯翊曰左辅都尉，扶风曰右辅都尉。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":91,"tongjian_id":"91c52e67-db0e-11ef-99cf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"91c52e5e-db0e-11ef-81f1-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"péng","source_anchor_text":"南山群盜傰宗等數百","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":5,"text":"傰","tongjian_id":"c0b12f66-554b-58dd-9d90-9de45d074c08"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","resolved_place_entity_id":1674,"start_index":73,"tongjian_id":"91c52e76-db0e-11ef-9236-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"9南山羣盜傰宗等數百人爲吏民害。詔發兵千人逐捕，歲餘不能禽。或說大將軍鳳，以「賊數百人在轂下，討不能得，難以示四夷；獨選賢京兆尹乃可。」於是鳳薦故高陵令王尊，徵爲諫大夫，守京輔都尉，行京兆尹事。旬月間，盜賊清；後拜爲京兆尹。","content_fanyi":"南山群盗傰宗等数百人侵害官府和百姓，成为一方祸害。汉成帝下诏调发一千名士兵追捕，历时一年多仍无法抓获。有人向大将军王凤进言说：“盗贼数百人就在京师附近，讨伐却不能抓获，难以向四方蛮夷显示朝廷威望；只有选用贤能的京兆尹才能办到。”于是王凤推荐前高陵县令王尊，征召入朝任谏大夫，代理京辅都尉，暂掌京兆尹事务。不到一个月，盗贼便被肃清；后来王尊被正式任命为京兆尹。","content_jianti_auto":"9南山群盗傰宗等数百人为吏民害。诏发兵千人逐捕，岁余不能禽。或说大将军凤，以「贼数百人在毂下，讨不能得，难以示四夷；独选贤京兆尹乃可。」于是凤荐故高陵令王尊，征为谏大夫，守京辅都尉，行京兆尹事。旬月间，盗贼清；后拜为京兆尹。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":2365,"number":9,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第三十 (漢紀二十二) / 孝成皇帝上之上 / 四年 / 第 10 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"91c52e5e-db0e-11ef-81f1-a0d3651f611f","year_int":-29},"tongjian_id":"91c52e5e-db0e-11ef-81f1-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":4},{"mention_count":2,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"高陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵县","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"93e2e797-db0e-11ef-b2a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"馮翊","place_name_jianti_auto":"冯翊","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"93e2e798-db0e-11ef-9c8a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"地理志，高陵縣屬馮翊。","note_content_jianti_auto":"地理志，高陵县属冯翊。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"93e2e796-db0e-11ef-8b11-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"王莽","people_name_jianti_auto":"王莽","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"93e2e79b-db0e-11ef-b8b5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"洛城門","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛城门","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"93e2e79c-db0e-11ef-abbb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"建子門","place_name_jianti_auto":"建子门","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"93e2e79d-db0e-11ef-a289-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長安","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"93e2e79e-db0e-11ef-b490-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廚城門","place_name_jianti_auto":"厨城门","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"93e2e79f-db0e-11ef-8af8-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長安","place_name_jianti_auto":"长安","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"93e2e7a0-db0e-11ef-9823-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"三輔黃圖曰：洛城門，王莽改曰建子門；其內有長安廚官，俗名之爲廚城門，今長安故城北面之中門是也。騎，奇寄翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"三辅黄图曰：洛城门，王莽改曰建子门；其内有长安厨官，俗名之为厨城门，今长安故城北面之中门是也。骑，奇寄翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":72,"tongjian_id":"93e2e79a-db0e-11ef-bc20-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"將，如字；領也，攜也，挾也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"将，如字；领也，携也，挟也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":142,"tongjian_id":"93e2e7a3-db0e-11ef-af5d-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"右輔","place_name_jianti_auto":"右辅","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"93e2e7a5-db0e-11ef-8edc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"郿","place_name_jianti_auto":"郿","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"93e2e7a6-db0e-11ef-8618-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"93e2e7a7-db0e-11ef-937c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"左輔","place_name_jianti_auto":"左辅","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"93e2e7a8-db0e-11ef-bb26-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"右輔都尉治郿。高陵，左輔都尉治所也。右，恐當作左。","note_content_jianti_auto":"右辅都尉治郿。高陵，左辅都尉治所也。右，恐当作左。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":153,"tongjian_id":"93e2e7a4-db0e-11ef-8156-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","resolved_place_entity_id":1674,"start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"93e322d0-db0e-11ef-bdd7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","resolved_place_entity_id":1674,"start_index":139,"tongjian_id":"93e322eb-db0e-11ef-be42-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、两汉 三国（卷二）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"","context_before":"","source_end_index":157,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6c9f78ba-8f8e-5952-a2c6-0e21e804de82","source_start_index":0,"source_text":"赤眉据长安。\n【史略】王莽时，琅邪樊崇等起兵于莒[今山东莒州。见前]，转掠青、徐间。更始入洛阳，遂降。寻复叛[崇初留兵濮阳，与其徒诣洛阳降。更始政乱，崇遂亡归。濮阳，见前]，将兵入颍川，分为二部：一自武关，一从陆浑[陆浑关，在河南嵩县北七十里]，而西俱会弘农。至郑[即今陕西华州治。见前]，立刘盆子为帝，遂入长安。"},{"context_after":"邓禹畏赤眉之强，引军北至栒邑[今陕西三水县东北二十五里有...","context_before":"...见今山西河津县]。吴汉等诸将共围洛阳，洛阳下，遂定都焉。","source_end_index":821,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f908cd4d-ba0f-5d87-a39e-ef88b491dfe1","source_start_index":806,"source_text":"是时，赤眉已入长安，更始败没。"}],"path":"历代州域形势纪要/二、两汉 三国（卷二）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"蓩，莫老反。《续汉志》弘农有蓩乡。○桃林驿，在今县治西，...","context_before":"蓩乡[在县西南五十里。","source_end_index":63,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"d10b8ea1-ecea-5396-ada6-fa063e0af4e0","source_start_index":11,"source_text":"后汉初，赤眉入长安，至弘农，更始遣将拒之，赤眉败更始将苏茂于枯枞山下，又败李松于蓩乡，转北至湖城，是也。"}],"path":"河南方舆纪要/一、开封府（卷四十七）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"初平三年，董卓部曲李傕等作乱，屯南宫掖门。王允扶帝上宣平...","context_before":"...莽改宣平门曰春王门正月亭。更始初，汉兵诛莽，从宣平门入。","source_end_index":561,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8851a334-ca2b-5400-bb0d-e71691f9c4ec","source_start_index":536,"source_text":"三年，赤眉自高陵进攻东都门。城门校尉李况开门纳之。"},{"context_after":"或曰广门，莽时更为建子门广世亭]。北出西头第一门，曰横门...","context_before":"...城门，亦曰朝门[长安城北面之中门也。内有长安厨宫，因名。","source_end_index":1247,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8851a334-ca2b-5400-bb0d-e71691f9c4ec","source_start_index":1227,"source_text":"赤眉入长安，更始单骑走，从厨城门出是也。"},{"context_after":"后废。西魏以后，复修治之。隋大业十三年，唐公渊军冯翊，进...","context_before":"...宫。《黄图》：从洛门至周庙门，中有长信宫。盖即长信殿矣。","source_end_index":218,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"f9f569fd-89aa-5149-9c50-8d1c056cefdf","source_start_index":203,"source_text":"赤眉入长安，刘盆子复居长乐宫。"},{"context_after":"今俗呼贞女楼，即建章故阙云。○明堂，在长安故城外。《水经...","context_before":"...。哀帝元寿二年，单于来朝，以太岁厌胜所在舍之，因起此宫。","source_end_index":168,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"795142ad-6540-589b-bb56-808ac60e563f","source_start_index":157,"source_text":"赤眉入长安，坏建章宫。"},{"context_after":"潘岳《关中记》：三辅旧治长安城中，长吏各在其县治民。光武...","context_before":"...母弟显为高陵君。又吕氏之变，代王乘传诣长安，至高陵休止。","source_end_index":74,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"ae262f21-25bf-5d68-95a2-0bbecc15ba3d","source_start_index":58,"source_text":"更始末，赤眉至高陵，王匡等迎降。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"晋亦属京兆郡。太安二年，河间王颙起兵长安，东逼京师，顿军...","context_before":"...秦，至郑而还。后入于秦。武公十一年，初置郑县。汉属京兆。","source_end_index":77,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"614bf3b9-d33a-5276-9595-b2f239542993","source_start_index":60,"source_text":"后汉初，赤眉入关，立刘盆子于郑北。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/二、西安府下（卷五十四）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"赤眉至高陵，王匡、張卬等迎降之，遂共連兵進攻東都門。李松出戰，赤眉生得松；松弟況爲城門校尉，開門納之。九月，赤眉入長安；更始單騎走，從廚城門出。式侯恭以赤眉立其弟，自繫詔獄；聞更始敗走，乃出，見定陶王祉，祉爲之除械，相與從更始於渭濱。右輔都尉嚴本，恐失更始爲赤眉所誅，卽將更始至高陵，本將兵宿衞，其實圍之。更始將相皆降赤眉，獨丞相曹竟不降，手劍格死。","content_fanyi":"赤眉军到达高陵县，王匡、张卬等人率军迎接赤眉军并投降，于是联合起来一同进攻长安的东都门。李松出城迎战，被赤眉军生擒；李松的弟弟李况担任城门校尉，打开城门迎接赤眉军进城。九月，赤眉军进入长安；更始帝刘玄单人独骑逃走，从厨城门逃出长安。式侯刘恭因为赤眉军拥立他的弟弟刘盆子为皇帝，就自己绑缚起来投案，被囚禁在诏狱中；听说更始帝兵败逃走，才出狱，见到定陶王刘祉，刘祉为他除去身上的刑具，一同追随更始帝到渭水河边。右辅都尉严本，担心一旦失去更始帝自己会被赤眉军诛杀，就把更始帝带到高陵县，严本率兵宿卫，实际上却是把更始帝包围看管起来。更始帝的将相都投降了赤眉军，只有丞相曹竟不肯投降，手持宝剑格斗而死。","content_jianti_auto":"赤眉至高陵，王匡、张卬等迎降之，遂共连兵进攻东都门。李松出战，赤眉生得松；松弟况为城门校尉，开门纳之。九月，赤眉入长安；更始单骑走，从厨城门出。式侯恭以赤眉立其弟，自系诏狱；闻更始败走，乃出，见定陶王祉，祉为之除械，相与从更始于渭滨。右辅都尉严本，恐失更始为赤眉所诛，即将更始至高陵，本将兵宿衞，其实围之。更始将相皆降赤眉，独丞相曹竟不降，手剑格死。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"，雒阳孤立无援，且坚壁固守，以杀伯升为惭而不降。故通更始...","context_before":"...，辞胶东之封；受命守雒，百战以与寇恂、冯异争死生之命；及","source_end_index":140,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"bc92de55-da78-4302-ab68-57d70722cdcf","source_start_index":130,"source_text":"长安破，更始降于赤眉"}],"title":"四 诛李轶封朱鲔"}],"id":3047,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十 (漢紀三十二) / 世祖光武皇帝上之上 / 建武元年 / 第 22 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"93e2e795-db0e-11ef-a8df-a0d3651f611f","year_int":25},"tongjian_id":"93e2e795-db0e-11ef-a8df-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":5},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"高陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"杜佑","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜佑","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9546305d-db0e-11ef-8a2c-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"槐里縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"槐里县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9546305e-db0e-11ef-94d0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9546305f-db0e-11ef-9161-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"槐里","place_name_jianti_auto":"槐里","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"95463060-db0e-11ef-9eca-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"95463061-db0e-11ef-9a9a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"犬丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"犬丘","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"95463062-db0e-11ef-a3a2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"95463063-db0e-11ef-b998-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"廢丘","place_name_jianti_auto":"废丘","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"95463064-db0e-11ef-879e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"95463065-db0e-11ef-9129-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"槐里","place_name_jianti_auto":"槐里","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"95463066-db0e-11ef-b9d3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"岐山","place_name_jianti_auto":"岐山","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"95463067-db0e-11ef-8621-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"扶风","start_index":35,"tongjian_id":"95463068-db0e-11ef-ac7b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"美陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"美阳县","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"95463069-db0e-11ef-8ac7-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"槐里縣，屬扶風。杜佑曰：槐里，周曰犬丘，秦曰廢丘，漢改曰槐里。岐山，在扶風美陽縣。","note_content_jianti_auto":"槐里县，属扶风。杜佑曰：槐里，周曰犬丘，秦曰废丘，汉改曰槐里。岐山，在扶风美阳县。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":33,"tongjian_id":"9546305c-db0e-11ef-b975-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","resolved_place_entity_id":1674,"start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"95463072-db0e-11ef-9e18-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"容斋随笔/资治通鉴","excerpts":[{"context_after":"；又乙未幸东阿，北登太行山，至天井关，夏四月乙卯还宫。又...","context_before":"...昌宣王和其奴卒，皆无关于社稷治乱。而周勃薨，乃不书。及书","source_end_index":576,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"bed14566-6877-48d4-869c-49a53aaa7eeb","source_start_index":538,"source_text":"汉章帝行幸长安，进幸槐里、岐山，又幸长平，御池阳宫，东至高陵，十二月丁亥还宫"}],"path":"续笔/卷四/资治通鉴","source_name":"容斋随笔"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...长安，宿长平阪。上自甘泉宿池阳宫，登长平阪，诏单于毋谒。","source_end_index":93,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"00313ef0-0d21-5276-bd66-1161099381a5","source_start_index":63,"source_text":"后汉建初七年，幸长平，御池阳宫，东至高陵，造舟于泾而还，是也"},{"context_after":"晋初为始平郡治。建兴四年，南阳王保镇上邽，遣其将胡崧救长...","context_before":"...丘。汉王引水灌之，废丘降，章邯自杀。汉三年，始置槐里县。","source_end_index":122,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"3b47a8b7-06d0-5cc3-8870-dbc2a2d09629","source_start_index":111,"source_text":"后汉建初七年，幸槐里。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"},{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、凤翔府（卷五十五）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"西魏大统十三年，宇文泰从魏主狩于岐阳。魏主廓三年，以岐阳...","context_before":"...王三年，三川竭，岐山崩。《吕氏春秋》：岐山，九山之一也。","source_end_index":145,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"331a9223-9183-5dc1-8d15-f3af54cb72fe","source_start_index":134,"source_text":"后汉建初七年，幸岐山。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/三、凤翔府（卷五十五）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"6冬，十月，癸丑，帝行幸長安，封蕭何末孫熊爲酇侯。進幸槐里、岐山；又幸長平，御池陽宮，東至高陵；十二月，丁亥，還宮。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十月十九日癸丑，汉章帝出巡长安，封萧何的末代孙萧熊为酇侯。继而巡行槐里、岐山；又巡行长平，入住池阳宫，东行到达高陵县；十二月丁亥日（疑误），返回宫中。","content_jianti_auto":"6冬，十月，癸丑，帝行幸长安，封萧何末孙熊为酂侯。进幸槐里、岐山；又幸长平，御池阳宫，东至高陵；十二月，丁亥，还宫。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":3697,"number":6,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第四十六 (漢紀三十八) / 肅宗孝章皇帝上 / 七年 / 第 6 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9546305b-db0e-11ef-863c-a0d3651f611f","year_int":82},"tongjian_id":"9546305b-db0e-11ef-863c-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":6},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"高陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"988616fe-db0e-11ef-bdf2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"馮翊","place_name_jianti_auto":"冯翊","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"988616ff-db0e-11ef-9c3a-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"高陵縣，屬馮翊。","note_content_jianti_auto":"高陵县，属冯翊。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"988616fd-db0e-11ef-90b8-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"復，扶又翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"复，扶又翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":98,"tongjian_id":"98861701-db0e-11ef-8aea-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"新豐","place_name_jianti_auto":"新丰","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"98861703-db0e-11ef-8f6d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"驪山","place_name_jianti_auto":"骊山","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"98861704-db0e-11ef-8383-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"終南","place_name_jianti_auto":"终南","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"98861705-db0e-11ef-b0fc-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南山","place_name_jianti_auto":"南山","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"98861706-db0e-11ef-8a39-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"自新豐驪山西接終南，謂之南山。","note_content_jianti_auto":"自新丰骊山西接终南，谓之南山。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":134,"tongjian_id":"98861702-db0e-11ef-aefe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","resolved_place_entity_id":1674,"start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"98861708-db0e-11ef-b2a9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"郭汜欲令車駕幸高陵，公卿及濟以爲宜幸弘農，大會議之，不決。帝遣使諭汜曰：「弘農近郊廟，勿有疑也！」汜不從。帝遂終日不食。汜聞之曰：「可且幸近縣。」八月，甲辰，車駕幸新豐。丙子，郭汜復謀脅帝還都郿，侍中种輯知之，密告楊定、董承、楊奉令會新豐。郭汜自知謀泄，乃棄軍入南山。","content_fanyi":"郭汜想让献帝前往高陵，公卿百官和张济认为应当前往弘农，便举行大会议论，仍不能决定。献帝派使者告谕郭汜说：“弘农靠近洛阳郊外祭祀天地和宗庙的地方，我没有别的意思，将军不要再犹豫。”郭汜不肯听从。献帝于是整天绝食，表示抗议。郭汜听说后说：“可以暂且先到附近的县城，再作商议。”八月初六日甲辰，献帝的车驾到达新丰。丙子日，郭汜又谋划胁迫献帝西还长安，定都郿县，侍中种辑得知了这个阴谋，秘密通知杨定、董承、杨奉，要他们到新丰会合。郭汜知道自己的阴谋泄露，便抛弃军队逃入终南山。","content_jianti_auto":"郭汜欲令车驾幸高陵，公卿及济以为宜幸弘农，大会议之，不决。帝遣使谕汜曰：「弘农近郊庙，勿有疑也！」汜不从。帝遂终日不食。汜闻之曰：「可且幸近县。」八月，甲辰，车驾幸新丰。丙子，郭汜复谋胁帝还都郿，侍中种辑知之，密告杨定、董承、杨奉令会新丰。郭汜自知谋泄，乃弃军入南山。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":5319,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第六十一 (漢紀五十三) / 孝獻皇帝丙 / 二年 / 第 20 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":19,"tongjian_id":"988616fc-db0e-11ef-9bab-a0d3651f611f","year_int":195},"tongjian_id":"988616fc-db0e-11ef-9bab-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":7},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"高陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"操","people_name_jianti_auto":"操","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9a4ccc3e-db0e-11ef-adec-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"操","people_name_jianti_auto":"操","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"9a4ccc3f-db0e-11ef-bbaf-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9a4ccc40-db0e-11ef-b27d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"鄴城","place_name_jianti_auto":"邺城","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"9a4ccc41-db0e-11ef-8d35-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"銅雀臺","place_name_jianti_auto":"铜雀台","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"9a4ccc42-db0e-11ef-a588-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"西陵","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"9a4ccc43-db0e-11ef-95f3-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西門豹祠","place_name_jianti_auto":"西门豹祠","start_index":37,"tongjian_id":"9a4ccc44-db0e-11ef-8060-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"高陵，在鄴城西。操遺令曰：汝等時時登銅雀臺，望吾西陵墓田。魏紀載操令曰：規西門豹祠西原上爲陵。","note_content_jianti_auto":"高陵，在邺城西。操遗令曰：汝等时时登铜雀台，望吾西陵墓田。魏纪载操令曰：规西门豹祠西原上为陵。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"9a4ccc3d-db0e-11ef-9b0d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","resolved_place_entity_id":1675,"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"9a4ccc47-db0e-11ef-bb0e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"5丁卯，葬武王于高陵。","content_fanyi":"丁卯这天，把魏王曹操安葬于邺城西面的高陵。","content_jianti_auto":"5丁卯，葬武王于高陵。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":5844,"number":5,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第六十九 (魏紀一) / 世祖文皇帝上 / 黃初元年 / 第 6 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"9a4ccc3c-db0e-11ef-b066-a0d3651f611f","year_int":220},"tongjian_id":"9a4ccc3c-db0e-11ef-b066-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":8},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"高陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"荀林父","people_name_jianti_auto":"荀林父","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9a5f4072-db0e-11ef-869b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"晉景公","people_name_jianti_auto":"晋景公","start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"9a5f4073-db0e-11ef-abe2-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"孟明","people_name_jianti_auto":"孟明","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"9a5f4074-db0e-11ef-b920-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"秦穆公","people_name_jianti_auto":"秦穆公","start_index":36,"tongjian_id":"9a5f4075-db0e-11ef-b1d4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"9a5f4076-db0e-11ef-ac0b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"9a5f4077-db0e-11ef-b2c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"邲","place_name_jianti_auto":"邲","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"9a5f4078-db0e-11ef-a332-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"赤狄","place_name_jianti_auto":"赤狄","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"9a5f4079-db0e-11ef-b02a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"秦","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"9a5f407a-db0e-11ef-8119-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"9a5f407b-db0e-11ef-9c3b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"殽","place_name_jianti_auto":"殽","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"9a5f407c-db0e-11ef-8257-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西戎","place_name_jianti_auto":"西戎","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"9a5f407d-db0e-11ef-b55b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"晉大夫荀林父與楚戰，敗于邲，晉景公復用之以取赤狄。秦大夫孟明爲晉禽于殽，秦穆公復用之以霸西戎。父，音甫。","note_content_jianti_auto":"晋大夫荀林父与楚战，败于邲，晋景公复用之以取赤狄。秦大夫孟明为晋禽于殽，秦穆公复用之以霸西戎。父，音甫。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"9a5f4071-db0e-11ef-93ef-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"安遠將軍號，亦前此未有也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"安远将军号，亦前此未有也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":40,"tongjian_id":"9a5f407e-db0e-11ef-81af-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"畫，古𦘕字通。","note_content_jianti_auto":"画，古𦘕字通。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":71,"tongjian_id":"9a5f407f-db0e-11ef-a749-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","resolved_place_entity_id":1675,"start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"9a5f4088-db0e-11ef-9f55-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"于禁須髮皓白，形容憔顇，見帝，泣涕頓首。帝慰諭以荀林父、孟明視故事，拜安遠將軍，令北詣鄴謁高陵。帝使豫於陵屋畫關羽戰克、龐德憤怒、禁降伏之狀。禁見，慙恚發病死。","content_fanyi":"于禁头发胡须都已雪白，面容憔悴，见到魏文帝后，流着泪跪拜叩首。魏文帝用古代晋国荀林父、秦国孟明视的故事安慰开导他，任命他为安远将军，命他北上邺都拜谒曹操的高陵。魏文帝事先派人在陵屋的墙壁上画了关羽获胜、庞德愤怒、于禁投降伏首的图画。于禁看到后，惭愧怨愤，发病而死。","content_jianti_auto":"于禁须发皓白，形容憔顇，见帝，泣涕顿首。帝慰谕以荀林父、孟明视故事，拜安远将军，令北诣邺谒高陵。帝使豫于陵屋画关羽战克、庞德愤怒、禁降伏之状。禁见，慙恚发病死。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":5888,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第六十九 (魏紀一) / 世祖文皇帝上 / 二年 / 第 21 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"9a5f406f-db0e-11ef-bbe2-a0d3651f611f","year_int":221},"tongjian_id":"9a5f406f-db0e-11ef-bbe2-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":9},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"高陵","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"a197a707-db0e-11ef-bd04-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"a197a708-db0e-11ef-86eb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"馮翊","place_name_jianti_auto":"冯翊","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a197a709-db0e-11ef-97a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"a197a70a-db0e-11ef-89f1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"高陸","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陆","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"a197a70b-db0e-11ef-82d6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"京兆","place_name_jianti_auto":"京兆","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"a197a70c-db0e-11ef-b7f5-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"高陵縣，漢屬馮翊；晉改曰高陸，屬京兆。","note_content_jianti_auto":"高陵县，汉属冯翊；晋改曰高陆，属京兆。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"a197a706-db0e-11ef-9a93-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"好畤縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"好畤县","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"a197a70e-db0e-11ef-965e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"前漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"前汉","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"a197a70f-db0e-11ef-862c-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"右扶風","place_name_jianti_auto":"右扶风","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"a197a710-db0e-11ef-b726-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"后汉","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"a197a711-db0e-11ef-bfc7-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"晉","place_name_jianti_auto":"晋","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"a197a712-db0e-11ef-8d57-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"磋，倉何翻。好畤縣，前漢屬右扶風，後漢、晉省。畤，音止。","note_content_jianti_auto":"磋，仓何翻。好畤县，前汉属右扶风，后汉、晋省。畤，音止。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"a197a70d-db0e-11ef-bb91-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"黃白城","place_name_jianti_auto":"黄白城","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"a197a714-db0e-11ef-9512-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"卽黃白城。酋，慈由翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"即黄白城。酋，慈由翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":30,"tongjian_id":"a197a713-db0e-11ef-a752-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"a197a705-db0e-11ef-829e-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"zhì","source_anchor_text":"徐磋屯好畤羌酋白犢","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":20,"text":"畤","tongjian_id":"c321c600-e2b6-56c7-aca3-4c2244123975"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"高陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"高陵","resolved_place_entity_id":1674,"start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"a197a71b-db0e-11ef-8098-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"]。","context_before":"...阳黄白城。晋愍帝初，刘曜等寇长安，诏麹允屯黄白城以拒之。","source_end_index":103,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"e6b6dcf1-fe83-5401-a623-98e041b73b09","source_start_index":77,"source_text":"永和六年，苻健入关中，羌酋白犊屯黄白，迎降于健，即此"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":[],"content":"健遣苻雄徇渭北。氐酋毛受屯高陵，徐磋屯好畤，羌酋白犢屯黃白，衆各數萬，皆斬洪使，遣子降於健。苻菁、魚遵所過城邑，無不降附。洪懼，固守長安。","content_fanyi":"苻健派苻雄领兵巡行渭水以北。氐人酋长毛受屯驻高陵，徐磋屯驻好畤，羌人酋长白犊屯驻黄白，各自拥有数万部众；他们都杀死杜洪的使者，派儿子前去向苻健投降。苻菁、鱼遵所经过的城邑，无不投降归附。杜洪恐惧，固守长安。","content_jianti_auto":"健遣苻雄徇渭北。氐酋毛受屯高陵，徐磋屯好畤，羌酋白犊屯黄白，众各数万，皆斩洪使，遣子降于健。苻菁、鱼遵所过城邑，无不降附。洪惧，固守长安。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":8527,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第九十八 (晉紀二十) / 孝宗穆皇帝上之下 / 六年 / 第 26 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"a197a705-db0e-11ef-829e-a0d3651f611f","year_int":350},"tongjian_id":"a197a705-db0e-11ef-829e-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":10}],"page_size":10,"total_pages":2,"total_paragraphs":14},"place_name":"高陵"},"message":"success","success":true}